Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:12:58 +0800
Subject: session-ui/tools: how long each tool call ran, next to its name

"Shell 12s", like "Thought 1s": execution time (time.ran to time.completed),
counting up while it runs, hidden under a second. Collapsed groups show the span
from their first start to their last end.

Ocelot-Patch: web/tool-elapsed

